  "stageId": "a003_08",
  "title": "Siesta Rhapsody",
  "storyCode": "OF-8",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "62be42f81c20cbe78e44e4b3f1fc6d3e53b4483cd7ae2a45d4ae8962f0645700",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "text": "Watch out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "text": "Haah!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "text": "Hyah!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "text": "Is it really getting weaker? I can't tell from the appearance at all!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "text": "Watch out for the lava! Just how much obsidian has this thing absorbed?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giant Originium Slug",
      "text": "GROOOAAAAARRRRR!!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "text": "Poor thing... But we can't afford to show it any mercy! Skyfire!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "text": "All right, I got it! Time to go all out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "text": "Well then, how do you like the taste of this?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giant Originium Slug",
      "text": "Grooooooarrr!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "text": "It's becoming enraged...! I'll block its way. The rest of you, focus on attacking!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "text": "Big tail!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "text": "I finally managed to land a hit through a crack in the lava, but I can't guarantee that it's going to work on something of this size!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giant Originium Slug",
      "text": "——————!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "text": "We did it! It's heading the other way!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "text": "Yes! The citizens are going to be safe now!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "text": "Good grief! I can't believe a single slug would be that hard to deal with! My skirt is all ruined...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "text": "It was the leader of the colony after all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "text": "If people didn't destroy their habitat in the first place, then perhaps...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "text": "I'm exhausted! Let's not bring up that tiresome topic again!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "text": "Haha, me too. I'm so tired I can barely stand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "text": "But, we have to head back to Siesta. There are people waiting for us there...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "text": "Oof!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "text": "That's understandable, but a mature lady should also learn to get help if she's not even able to keep her balance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "text": "Th-thank you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "text": "All right, let's go take our victory lap now. Once we get back, there might still be some time for us to enjoy our vacation.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "text": "But... sooner or later, this place will...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "text": "Big tail?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "text": "Ah, I'm coming.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "text": "Skyfire...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "text": "I know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "text": "But we should respect the city's choice, and let them handle the rest, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
